   ("NT" "CLD-P3-ICT-TABLO" 255342.8 18710.0 25.0 "NOTLAR" ("1- Tesisat Elektrik \\U+0130\\U+00E7 Tesisleri Y\\U+00F6netmeli\\U+011Fi, TS HD 60364 ve TS EN 12464-1 esas al\\U+0131narak hesaplanm\\U+0131\\U+015Ft\\U+0131r." "2- Ayd\\U+0131nlatma ve priz tesisat\\U+0131 ayr\\U+0131 paftalarda g\\U+00F6sterilmi\\U+015Ftir; linye etiketi \"PANO/L\\U+0130NYE\", ok y\\U+00F6n\\U+00FC panoyu g\\U+00F6sterir." "3- Kesitler IEC 60364-5-52 C y\\U+00F6ntemi x 0,80 (ofis) / x 0,71 (\\U+00FCretim hol\\U+00FC tavas\\U+0131, 40 \\U+00B0C) ile se\\U+00E7ilmi\\U+015Ftir; gerilim d\\U+00FC\\U+015F\\U+00FCm\\U+00FC ayd\\U+0131nlatma ve prizde \\U+2264 %1,5, kuvvette \\U+2264 %3 olacak \\U+015Fekilde linyeler b\\U+00F6l\\U+00FCnm\\U+00FC\\U+015Ft\\U+00FCr." "4- Ka\\U+00E7ak ak\\U+0131m: t\\U+00FCm tek fazl\\U+0131 son devreler (priz, ayd\\U+0131nlatma, \\U+0131slak hacim, \\U+00F6zel \\U+00E7\\U+0131k\\U+0131\\U+015F) 30 mA, bilgisayar/VRF A tipi; 3 fazl\\U+0131 motor devreleri 300 mA; pano giri\\U+015Fleri 300 mA S (se\\U+00E7ici) - TS HD 60364-4-41 411.3.3, EMO." "5- Ofis ve \\U+0131slak hacimlerde s\\U+0131va alt\\U+0131 spiral boru, \\U+00FCretim alan\\U+0131nda galvaniz kablo tavas\\U+0131 / boru kullan\\U+0131lacakt\\U+0131r." "6- \"AK\" acil kitli armat\\U+00FCrler kontakt\\U+00F6r \\U+00F6ncesinden s\\U+00FCrekli faz ile beslenir (NYM 4x..: L anahtarl\\U+0131 + L s\\U+00FCrekli, TS EN 50172)." "7- Acil ve y\\U+00F6nlendirme armat\\U+00FCrleri 3 saat bataryal\\U+0131d\\U+0131r (Binalar\\U+0131n Yang\\U+0131ndan Korunmas\\U+0131 Hakk\\U+0131nda Y\\U+00F6netmelik, TS EN 1838)." "8- End\\U+00FCstriyel priz grubu kutusu i\\U+00E7inde 4P C32, C16 ve 2xB16 sigortalar ile 30 mA (A tipi) ka\\U+00E7ak ak\\U+0131m r\\U+00F6lesi bulunur." "9- Anahtarlar sahada kap\\U+0131 a\\U+00E7\\U+0131l\\U+0131\\U+015F y\\U+00F6n\\U+00FCne g\\U+00F6re kap\\U+0131 kanad\\U+0131n\\U+0131n arkas\\U+0131nda kalmayacak \\U+015Fekilde yerle\\U+015Ftirilecektir." "10- \\U+00DCretim alan\\U+0131 ayd\\U+0131nla